IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0014.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    05 OV-AMT             PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 SL-CD              PIC X.
    05 D-ZN               PIC X(2).
       88 D-Z7-OR-Z8 VALUES 'Z7' 'Z8'.
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 WS-FSH             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 WS-SHC             PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
    05 X-CG               PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM FREE-SHIPPING
    PERFORM ZONE-SURCHARGE
    DISPLAY "WS-FSH=" WS-FSH
    DISPLAY "WS-SHC=" WS-SHC
    DISPLAY "X-CG=" X-CG
    STOP RUN.
FREE-SHIPPING.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF OV-AMT >= 80
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF OV-AMT >= 100
       AND SL-CD = 'S'
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FSH
        MOVE 0 TO WS-SHC
    END-IF.
ZONE-SURCHARGE.
    IF D-Z7-OR-Z8
        MOVE 15 TO X-CG
    END-IF.
